OL,3,GNEWSAStolen car gets stuck in roadworks
OL,4,Aduring police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chase of a stolen car came to
OL,7,Fan end after it got stuck in roadworks
OL,8,Fon the M65 and the occupants ran off.
OL,10,FA black Land Rover Discovery, stolen
OL,11,Ffrom Clayton-le-Moors at about 22:45
OL,12,FBST on Wednesday, was seen driving into
OL,13,FRishton in convoy with a blue Volvo on
OL,14,Fcloned number plates, Lancashire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe force said officers followed the
OL,18,FVolvo, which went on the wrong side of
OL,19,Fthe road and rammed a police car, until
OL,20,Fit got caught in a traffic jam.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
