OL,3,GNEWSAStolen car gets stuck in roadworks
OL,4,Aduring police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man from Bacup has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving and failing to stop. A
OL,9,F36-year-old man from Clayton-le-Moors
OL,10,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of theft
OL,11,Fof a motor vehicle, dangerous driving
OL,12,Fand failing to stop.
